ui-options-pipboy-music-audible-to-others = Pip-Boy music audible to others
ui-options-pipboy-music-audible-to-others-tooltip = When enabled, other nearby players will hear music from your Pip-Boy. When disabled, only you will hear it.
ui-options-portable-media-player-audible-to-others = Hear music from other media players
ui-options-portable-media-player-audible-to-others-tooltip = When enabled, you will hear music from other players' media players nearby. When disabled, only your own.
